	(gr_text "FAB NOTES (V3 radar):\n1. Material Isola 370HR, 4 layers, 1.274 mm: F.Cu / 0.254 prepreg / In1 GND / 0.606 core / In2 GND / 0.254 / B.Cu.\n2. Controlled impedance: 50 ohm microstrip on F.Cu over In1, 0.493 mm (LPI mask on). Tolerance +-10 %.\n3. Vias in the exposed pads of U12-U17 (LNA / mixer): IPC-4761 Type VII, filled and capped (VIPPO).\n4. Copper 1 oz finished, ENIG, LPI solder mask both sides (the EM models include the mask)."
		(at 20 198 0)
